### 👶 Register a new user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "coolUser123",
  "email": "cool@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123"
}

### 🔑 Login with credentials
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cool@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123"
}

### 📱 Create new contact (replace TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "lastname": "Smith",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "phoneNo": "9876543210"
}

### 📇 Get all contacts (replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 🔍 Search contacts by name (replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts?name=Alice
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ✏️ Update contact (replace ID and TOKEN)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/123456
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "phoneNo": "5556667777"
}

### 🗑️ Delete contact (replace ID and TOKEN)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/123456
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 👤 Get current user (replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/current
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE